{"about_the_game":"<strong>There was something rotten in that old hospital. You were just following your instincts that night. But, it was your pride that killed those people, including your partner on the force. With nothing to exonerate you, on a temporary insanity defense, they threw the book at you.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/754320/extras/3655f454c0e4afd0af47908c4e5f1ce1.avif?t=1735268002\" width=600 height=254 /></span></h2><br>For ten years, you were haunted by unanswered questions, frightened by what you saw, and what you did. Now you\u2019re scraping by as a private eye, operating out of a crummy apartment. One day, a strange case comes along, giving you an opportunity to clear your name once and for all. With your sanity at stake and rent to pay, how can you refuse?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/754320/extras/873b9ae72d3909504b64db9c104040ee.poster.avif?t=1735268002\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/754320/extras/873b9ae72d3909504b64db9c104040ee.webm?t=1735268002\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/754320/extras/873b9ae72d3909504b64db9c104040ee.mp4?t=1735268002\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Solve a wide variety of mysteries as Pinnacle City's cheapest Private Eye! From missing pets to murder investigations, your detective skills will either earn you fortune or face punches. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/754320/extras/2484ffd955bb745620575877d87431e6.poster.avif?t=1735268002\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/754320/extras/2484ffd955bb745620575877d87431e6.webm?t=1735268002\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/754320/extras/2484ffd955bb745620575877d87431e6.mp4?t=1735268002\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Home to a wretched hive of scum and villainy, Pinnacle City is littered with black market trade, grafters, and players of all kinds. From the shadowy alleys of The Sprawl to the sleek skyscrapers of Uptown, each district holds its own charm and mysteries to uncover! <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/754320/extras/3e99ed053ce16fb70ba0134638635c3d.poster.avif?t=1735268002\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/754320/extras/3e99ed053ce16fb70ba0134638635c3d.webm?t=1735268002\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/754320/extras/3e99ed053ce16fb70ba0134638635c3d.mp4?t=1735268002\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Each member of your entourage has their own distinctive personality and skill set. Some will follow you into battle. Others will try and undermine you. Who will you choose for your lineup and will they be with you until the bitter end?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/754320/extras/75232122fb0262ca855ba70b5034be6b.poster.avif?t=1735268002\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/754320/extras/75232122fb0262ca855ba70b5034be6b.webm?t=1735268002\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/754320/extras/75232122fb0262ca855ba70b5034be6b.mp4?t=1735268002\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Bad guys can jump out at you from anywhere and each gang in Pinnacle City has its own devastating attacks! But you can beat 'em back in turn-based combat using timed hits and blocks to increase or reduce damage. You can also partner with your entourage members to unleash devastating combo attacks!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/754320/extras/1774c7f14ee7ce43c1485ea6feaeaaac.avif?t=1735268002\" width=600 height=150 /></span><br>Manuscripts teach entourage members a wide variety of skills. Learned skills can then be upgraded by skill points you get from solving major cases. With each upgrade, skills become more powerful, and your entourage can take on even more powerful enemies. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/754320/extras/7aa2823f5c760d71dc79e892c1c4c67b.avif?t=1735268002\" width=600 height=150 /></span><br>Tune up your gear with modifications to fit your play style. Experiment with different mods and ammo types to deal varying types of damage and inflict status effects on enemies. Whether you prefer a technical approach or go in guns blazing, modifying your gear is key as you battle your way through the city.<br><br></strong>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"8de842d6e64ef4993750d3fba8f59404f1e82933.jpg","localized_name":"Sleuth Hound","name":"Sleuth Hound","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/754320/8de842d6e64ef4993750d3fba8f59404f1e82933.jpg"},{"icon":"8de842d6e64ef4993750d3fba8f59404f1e82933.jpg","localized_name":"Last Day on the Force","name":"Last Day on the Force","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/754320/8de842d6e64ef4993750d3fba8f59404f1e82933.jpg"},{"icon":"8de842d6e64ef4993